[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238685\">7010E94</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the bulkhead.</p><p>2. Remove the bulkhead (2a) via the opening (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019047.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the anti-theft partition\nis not damaged.</p><p>Place the anti-theft partition in position\nand secure it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238685\">7010E94</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p>"]]